WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:32.166
Where does a person get the patience

2
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:33.625
to endure sensory desires

3
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.833
and tendencies for enjoyment?

4
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.333
Lord Krishna answers

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.541
this question in this verse...

6
00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.833
He says,

7
00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:45.125
the nature of the soul is to attain happiness...

8
00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:47.083
and when it experiences inner joy

9
00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:49.083
and wisdom,

10
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:53.541
it becomes unaffected by material tendencies

11
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.458
This is the state when one attains inner

12
00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:59.750
peace and the Supreme,

13
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.916
experiencing true happiness!!

14
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:10.791
Have you ever wondered why a lotus flower

15
00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:12.041
appears so beautiful

16
00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:15.875
and effective despite living in mud?

17
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.916
The reason is, it remains unaffected by the mud

18
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:21.083
despite living in it...

19
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:22.416
Similarly,

20
00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:25.625
a wise person remains unaffected

21
00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:29.041
by material attachments and illusions 
while living in this material world....

22
00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.250
The person who attains spiritual knowledge

23
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.166
becomes familiar with this truth,

24
00:01:35.166 --> 00:01:37.250
that lasting peace and happiness can

25
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.666
never be obtained from material pleasures.

26
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.875
It will only come from one's

27
00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:42.333
spiritual connection

28
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:44.833
with the Supreme.

29
00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:48.708
Lord Krishna calls this inner
 happiness "antah-sukha"...

30
00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:49.666
Such a person

31
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:51.291
experiences contentment

32
00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.333
and joy within....

33
00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:55.208
This is "antararam"....

34
00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:56.666
Their inner world becomes so

35
00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.875
rich and complete

36
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:01.250
that the ups and downs of the outer world

37
00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.791
cannot affect their peace…

38
00:02:03.791 --> 00:02:05.625
Lord Krishna addresses this self-centered state

39
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.375
as "antar-jyotih"…

40
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:10.500
which means

41
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.875
that person's energy,

42
00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:15.083
their guidance, comes from within…

43
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:18.541
allowing them to progress 
on the path of liberation.

44
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.166
When a person attains this state,

45
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:23.875
they achieve "Brahma-nirvana"...

46
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:26.375
This term might sound complex,

47
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:29.625
but it means the beginning of a life centered

48
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:30.708
on spiritual truth

49
00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:32.541
after being freed

50
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.541
from material illusions!!

51
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:34.833
Brahma-

52
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:36.083
nirvana doesn't mean

53
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:38.333
renouncing worldly life...

54
00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:40.458
rather it's a state

55
00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:43.458
where material desires cease

56
00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:44.208
and one

57
00:02:44.208 --> 00:02:45.208
enters a superior,

58
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.541
meaningful spiritual

59
00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:48.416
life.

60
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:49.416
This state

61
00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:51.041
leads a person toward lasting happiness

62
00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:53.250
and peace....

63
00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:53.833
This verse

64
00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:56.666
also confirms other verses of the Gita...

65
00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:58.500
which emphasize the 
importance of turning inward

66
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:02.708
and finding lasting happiness within oneself...

67
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:10.125
Have you ever thought about

68
00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:13.583
what the main source of a lamp's light is …

69
00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.666
the flame burning

70
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.541
above it...

71
00:03:18.541 --> 00:03:23.041
or the oil and wick hidden inside it...?

72
00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:27.041
Perhaps you know the answer to this question...

73
00:03:27.041 --> 00:03:30.625
Just as the main source of a lamp's light comes

74
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:34.750
from the oil and wick hidden inside it,

75
00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:38.041
similarly, the light of happiness

76
00:03:38.041 --> 00:03:42.041
and peace in your life comes 
not from material objects,

77
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:46.333
but from within you...

78
00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:50.708
When you are happy and content from within...

79
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:56.166
then you remain free from 
the web of material desires.

80
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:59.375
In your life, you struggle with material desires

81
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:02.708
and impulses,

82
00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:06.291
like craving for material pleasures,

83
00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:10.541
anger, or disappointment.

84
00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:13.500
Perhaps you feel

85
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.708
that you can control these

86
00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:19.250
with your willpower...

87
00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.375
but

88
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:24.083
to control them,

89
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:27.125
you need to develop inner happiness

90
00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:31.333
and spiritual connection within yourself...

91
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:36.041
When you experience emptiness
 within yourself...

92
00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:40.250
then you search for joy in material objects...

93
00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.875
such as wealth, material achievements, or

94
00:04:44.875 --> 00:04:47.500
means of momentary pleasure.

95
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:50.541
But this is just like

96
00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:55.333
drinking salty seawater when thirsty...

97
00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:56.458
It might

98
00:04:56.458 --> 00:05:00.041
provide satisfaction for a moment,

99
00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:02.625
but after some time

100
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:05.541
increases your thirst.

101
00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:07.500
Remember,

102
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.541
the nature of the soul is to attain happiness.

103
00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:16.166
When that happiness is 
not obtained from within,

104
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:17.125
then it

105
00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:21.416
tries to find it in material objects.

106
00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:22.541
And this temporary

107
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:26.500
happiness is the cause of human suffering.

108
00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.375
Supreme joy and lasting

109
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:31.625
happiness come to you only and only

110
00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:34.875
from within...

111
00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:37.083
But

112
00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:38.541
now this question

113
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:43.333
must be arising in your mind, that supreme joy

114
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:48.541
and lasting happiness, how does one attain it?

115
00:05:48.541 --> 00:05:49.750
For attaining lasting happiness

116
00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.541
and supreme joy,

117
00:05:52.541 --> 00:05:57.291
you need constant spiritual practice...

118
00:05:57.291 --> 00:06:00.166
such as chanting, meditation,

119
00:06:00.166 --> 00:06:04.208
devotional singing, prayer, and self-reflection...

120
00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:06.250
When you through these practices

121
00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.666
experience the divinity hidden

122
00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:10.291
in your soul.

123
00:06:10.291 --> 00:06:12.416
Then your soul's

124
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:16.250
connection with the Supreme begins to develop.

125
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.916
And your dependence on material pleasures

126
00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:22.541
gradually diminishes.

127
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:25.041
You become free from the web of fulfilling

128
00:06:25.041 --> 00:06:28.541
your desires and tendencies.

129
00:06:28.541 --> 00:06:31.250
And experience lasting happiness

130
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.250
and peace in life...

131
00:06:38.416 --> 00:06:41.583
Have you ever seen a tree

132
00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:44.333
that is very tall in height,

133
00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:48.291
but has weak roots...?

134
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:50.333
Seen it?

135
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:52.166
No, right!!

136
00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:54.625
The taller and bigger a tree is,

137
00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:58.666
the stronger its roots are...

138
00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:00.583
And because of them, it

139
00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:03.916
remains stable in every situation...

140
00:07:03.916 --> 00:07:11.833
Just as a tree needs strong roots to
 face every situation,

141
00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:14.625
similarly, society also

142
00:07:14.625 --> 00:07:20.041
needs to strengthen its inner roots.

143
00:07:20.041 --> 00:07:24.791
Today, you and the entire society

144
00:07:24.791 --> 00:07:27.583
are focusing on the height of
 material achievements,

145
00:07:27.583 --> 00:07:32.375
but

146
00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:36.750
ignoring the roots of inner strength.

147
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:41.166
Present-day society has 
accepted wealth, prestige,

148
00:07:41.166 --> 00:07:46.208
and material success as the supreme goal.

149
00:07:46.208 --> 00:07:47.791
And giving them

150
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:51.791
the most importance...

151
00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:53.791
As a result,

152
00:07:53.791 --> 00:07:57.208
imbalance in society has increased.

153
00:07:57.208 --> 00:08:01.125
Every individual is trapped in the maze
 of craving for material pleasures

154
00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:05.500
and achievements.

155
00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.083
And this maze of craving ultimately

156
00:08:08.083 --> 00:08:11.333
provides only discontent, stress,

157
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:15.291
and conflict.

158
00:08:15.291 --> 00:08:18.458
Today society needs a big change.

159
00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:21.791
It should prioritize inner development

160
00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:23.291
and spiritual progress

161
00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:27.583
along with external achievements.

162
00:08:27.583 --> 00:08:29.750
If you observe carefully,

163
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.458
you will realize that when society

164
00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:35.541
values only external achievements,

165
00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:38.833
then every individual for 
the attainment of wealth, prestige,

166
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:41.458
and material pleasures

167
00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:46.541
neglects their inner peace and happiness.

168
00:08:46.541 --> 00:08:49.750
This gives birth to a culture

169
00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.166
where there is glitter,

170
00:08:52.166 --> 00:08:55.583
but inside there is only

171
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:57.833
discontent, unrest,

172
00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:01.750
disappointment, and emptiness.

173
00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.708
If society prioritizes and 
rewards inner qualities like

174
00:09:05.708 --> 00:09:14.166
self-awareness, compassion,
 patience, and inner peace,

175
00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:19.083
then a new perspective can
emerge in everyone's life

176
00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:22.083
and the entire structure of collective life

177
00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:23.750
 can change.

178
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.500
Imagine a society...

179
00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.500
where human

180
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.500
values receive the highest respect…

181
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.541
where schools

182
00:09:31.541 --> 00:09:35.125
and workplaces teach emotional intelligence,

183
00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:39.166
patience, and inner peace

184
00:09:39.166 --> 00:09:42.208
along with technical skills.

185
00:09:42.208 --> 00:09:44.541
where individuals are honoured,

186
00:09:44.541 --> 00:09:47.750
who are not only materially successful

187
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:52.541
but also happy and content from within.

188
00:09:52.541 --> 00:09:56.708
Such a society will not only be
 materially prosperous

189
00:09:56.708 --> 00:10:00.791
but will also progress spiritually.

190
00:10:00.791 --> 00:10:04.041
In that society, there will be
 neither disagreements

191
00:10:04.041 --> 00:10:06.458
nor discrimination.

192
00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:09.291
Such a society alone will be balanced,

193
00:10:09.291 --> 00:10:12.666
happy, and prosperous.

194
00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:20.583
Have you ever thought about

195
00:10:20.583 --> 00:10:23.458
what an influential and

196
00:10:23.458 --> 00:10:27.708
successful leadership looks like?

197
00:10:27.708 --> 00:10:28.875
An influential

198
00:10:28.875 --> 00:10:32.041
and successful leader

199
00:10:32.041 --> 00:10:35.541
doesn't depend on material praise.

200
00:10:35.541 --> 00:10:36.500
Nor do they

201
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:40.416
become a puppet in the hands of circumstances,

202
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:42.208
neither does their self-

203
00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:47.666
respect depend on praise, nor on criticism!!!.

204
00:10:47.666 --> 00:10:49.541
A successful leader

205
00:10:49.541 --> 00:10:52.291
is familiar with the truth.

206
00:10:52.291 --> 00:10:57.791
that if true satisfaction is desired 
in professional life,

207
00:10:57.791 --> 00:10:58.875
then they

208
00:10:58.875 --> 00:11:03.791
must take responsibility for their own happiness

209
00:11:03.791 --> 00:11:05.625
and develop themselves

210
00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:09.625
internally.

211
00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:14.166
When you base your happiness and self-worth

212
00:11:14.166 --> 00:11:18.541
on material praise or rewards

213
00:11:18.541 --> 00:11:22.041
then you become subject to those waves

214
00:11:22.041 --> 00:11:24.041
which can come sometimes like peace

215
00:11:24.041 --> 00:11:27.458
and sometimes like a storm.

216
00:11:27.458 --> 00:11:29.875
Sometimes you will be praised,

217
00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:32.541
sometimes criticized. And this

218
00:11:32.541 --> 00:11:37.041
will make your emotional life unstable.

219
00:11:37.041 --> 00:11:39.416
Remember,

220
00:11:39.416 --> 00:11:40.583
successful leadership

221
00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:42.083
is not about

222
00:11:42.083 --> 00:11:45.791
chasing applause and awards,

223
00:11:45.791 --> 00:11:49.875
but about remaining internally stable,

224
00:11:49.875 --> 00:11:53.458
self-aware, and peaceful.

225
00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:57.125
Their inner stability enables 
them to inspire others

226
00:11:57.125 --> 00:12:02.250
without any selfishness or pressure.

227
00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.375
When an organizational leader

228
00:12:04.375 --> 00:12:07.500
moves forward with this integrity,

229
00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:12.416
other members adopt it not by command,

230
00:12:12.416 --> 00:12:15.625
but naturally,

231
00:12:15.625 --> 00:12:16.750
because

232
00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.500
they experience confidence

233
00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.041
and stability in them .

234
00:12:21.041 --> 00:12:21.750
When you

235
00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.250
prioritize spiritual growth,

236
00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:28.041
then you are known not only 
as a successful leader,

237
00:12:28.041 --> 00:12:31.541
but

238
00:12:31.541 --> 00:12:34.333
also become a good colleague and

239
00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:37.708
a successful professional!!
